  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Action Against Corruption (SAAC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall objective: To improve democratic accountability and transparency in South Africa through the empowerment of its citizens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective 1: To enhance the role of rural communities in contributing to governance, accountability, and transparency in the Eastern Cape Province (ECP).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specific objective 2: To improve advocacy at local and national level to eradicate corruption utilising knowledge and evidence gathered in rural communities of the ECP.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
